{"id":"u-2b3031d0-5909-44a5-a75b-56e61ad45094","src":"community","title":"Custom 5/3/1 BBB – Chest & Shoulder Focus (1)","author":"Matija Lozančić","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/Jm9B6P-custom-531-bbb-chest-and-shoulder-focus-1","desc":"Custom 5/3/1 BBB - Chest & Shoulder Focus is a practical adaptation of the proven 5/3/1 BBB training approach, with adjustments made through training experience to better balance strength development, muscle growth, recovery, and overall exercise selection.\n\nThe program keeps the core principles of 5/3/1: progressive main-lift training, manageable supplemental volume, and consistent work on the four foundational barbell lifts. Around that foundation, assistance work is selected to provide additional upper-body development while avoiding unnecessary overlap and excessive fatigue.\n\nThe chest and shoulders receive additional attention, while pulling, arms, core, and loaded-carry work are included to maintain a balanced approach. Some assistance work is intentionally kept optional, allowing training volume to be adjusted based on recovery, energy, and individual needs.\n\nThis program is intended for intermediate lifters who already have experience with the basic barbell movements and want a structured strength-and-hypertrophy program without unnecessary complexity. It is particularly suited to lifters who appreciate the simplicity and progression of 5/3/1 but want a more personalized balance of strength work and upper-body development.\n\nThe goal is not to reinvent 5/3/1, but to build on a proven foundation and make practical adjustments that can work well in real-world training.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":70,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-15T14:06:57.810Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":40},{"r":5,"pct":50},{"r":3,"pct":60},{"r":